### Why Perses?

| Feature | Benefit |
|---------|---------|
| **CNCF Sandbox Project** | Vendor-neutral, community-driven |
| **Dashboard-as-Code** | GitOps native, version controlled |
| **Plugin Architecture** | Extensible panels & data sources |
| **Multi-tenant** | Built for platform teams at scale |
| **API-First Design** | Perfect for AI integration |

