### Example Queries → Results

| Ask | Get |
|-----|-----|
| *"Show errors in checkout"* | Auto-generated error dashboard with logs |
| *"Compare to last week"* | Time-shifted overlay visualization |
| *"Why did latency spike at 3pm?"* | Correlated metrics + deployment events |
| *"Set up an alert for this"* | Perses alerting rule + notification |

### Key Takeaways

- **Reduce MTTR** — Get to root cause faster with natural language
- **Democratize observability** — Every engineer can query metrics
- **Perses + AI** — The future of cloud-native dashboarding

